      "player": "MstLg Stats",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "**Sequencing:**\n- You have **2 Mountains** and **1 Swamp** left in hand.\n- You already have **1 Mountain** in play (untapped).\n- You want to ensure you can cast **Goblin Wizardry** (3R) or **Kinetic Augur** (3R) on **Turn 3**.\n- Playing a **Mountain** now ensures you have **2 mana** available for **Turn 2** (e.g., to play **Thermo-Alchemist** if you haven’t already).\n- You don’t need the **Swamp** yet since you have no black spells you need to cast immediately.\n\n**Play:** **Mountain** for Turn 2.\n\n---\n**Chat:** \"Nice Thieves' Guild Enforcer. Let’s see if you can get to 8 mill before I burn you out.\"",
