      "seq": 24,
      "player": "MstLg Stats",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "**Play Thermo-Alchemist?**\n- **Pros:**\n  - Provides a **blocker** to protect against early aggression.\n  - Can **ping for 1 damage** each turn, contributing to face damage.\n  - Untaps when you cast instants/sorceries, enabling multiple activations per turn.\n  - Synergizes with **Double Vision** (if drawn) and other instants/sorceries.\n- **Cons:**\n  - **Defender** means it can’t attack, but this is a minor downside given its utility.\n  - Doesn’t advance your board presence as much as **Goblin Wizardry** or **Kinetic Augur**, but those are **Turn 3+** plays.\n\n**Verdict:** **Play Thermo-Alchemist.** It’s a **low-cost, high-value** play that provides defense, chip damage, and synergy with your deck’s strategy.\n\n---\n**Chat:** \"Thermo-Alchemist joining the party. Let’s see if you can handle the heat.\"",
