      "reasoning": "**Play Fell Specter?**\n- **Pros:**\n  - **Flying** makes it difficult for the opponent to block.\n  - **Forces the opponent to discard a card**, which triggers **2 life loss** for them (bringing them to **14 life**).\n  - **Synergizes with your deck**—every discard triggers **2 life loss**, and you can chain this with other discard effects.\n  - **Pressures the opponent’s hand** and life total simultaneously.\n- **Cons:**\n  - **3 mana** is a bit slow, but you have the mana available.\n  - Doesn’t directly win the game, but it **accelerates your clock**.\n\n**Verdict:** **Cast Fell Specter.** It’s a **high-impact play** that pressures the opponent’s hand and life total.\n\n---\n**Chat:** \"Fell Specter’s here to ruin your day. Discard a card—let’s see if you can afford to lose another one. Your life total’s dropping fast, and your mill plan’s still stuck at 7.\"",
