      "reasoning": "**Attackers:**\n- You have **Fell Specter (1/3 Flying)** available to attack.\n- Opponent has **Masked Blackguard (2/1)** and **Nocturnal Feeder (2/1, tapped)** in play.\n- **Masked Blackguard** is a **2/1**, so it can **chump block** your **Fell Specter** and die.\n- **Nocturnal Feeder** is **tapped**, so it can’t block.\n\n**Combat Math:**\n- If you attack with **Fell Specter (1/3 Flying)**, the opponent can **chump block with Masked Blackguard (2/1)** and take **0 damage**.\n- If you **don’t attack**, you preserve **Fell Specter** for future turns or to block.\n\n**Verdict:** **Attack with Fell Specter.** Even if the opponent **chump blocks**, you force them to **sacrifice Masked Blackguard**, which is a **net positive** for you. If they **don’t block**, you deal **1 damage** and bring them to **12 life**.\n\n---\n**Chat:** \"Fell Specter’s flying in for 1—let’s see if you can afford to lose Masked Blackguard. Your life total’s dropping fast, and my board’s intact.\"",
