      "reasoning": "**Play Double Vision?**\n- **Pros:**\n  - **Copies your first instant/sorcery spell each turn**, which can **double your damage output** (e.g., **Hungry Flames** or **Living Lightning**).\n  - **Synergizes with Thermo-Alchemist**—casting an instant/sorcery untaps it, allowing you to **activate it again** for **1 damage**.\n  - **Long-term value**—can generate **multiple copies** of key spells.\n- **Cons:**\n  - **5 mana** is a **big investment**, but you have the mana available.\n  - **Doesn’t immediately impact the board**, but sets up **future turns**.\n\n**Verdict:** **Cast Double Vision.** It’s a **high-impact play** that enables **future turns** and synergizes with your **Thermo-Alchemist** and **instant/sorcery spells**.\n\n---\n**Chat:** \"Double Vision’s here to double your misery. Your life total’s dropping, and my board’s only getting stronger. Let’s see if you can stabilize before I close this out.\"",
